{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1000_p", "source_sha256": "247a90c7e10b0a7159bacc514693ff50510a90a319dc65f27f871736aba5f346", "ja": "（次の劇場公演の目玉は、エレナの新曲お披露目だ。\nけど、その前に……）", "zh": "（下一场剧场公演的重头戏是艾蕾娜的新曲首次披露。\n不过，在那之前……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1001_p", "source_sha256": "776e9667a8ba0fd8cef12f3826fa3dc405291d30ca30583c83aaf2f247c297d1", "ja": "エレナ、実は相談したい事が……ん？\n難しい顔をして、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "艾莲娜，其实我有件事想和你商量……嗯？\n你愁眉苦脸的，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "52e644e5cf598c6ec8cb9ed10cf963b1576644c0cb1cccf00225cdfbd91bc26f", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nううん、なんでもないヨー。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n没什么，什么事也没有啦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "6f3d8941634b656c970af224cd421ff03f636247c7e9a39238b8ca4cd43e54d0", "ja": "それより、ワタシだけ早く来てって、どうかしたノ？\n何かあった？", "zh": "话说回来，叫我一个人早点来，是怎么啦？出什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f8befacf8f21c66d1f2b1109503e49750ecaddd42fb9fcd31beb4f13aab8af02", "ja": "あ、うん。\nエレナに、仕事の話が来てるんだ。", "zh": "啊，嗯。\n艾蕾娜接到工作邀约了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d13eae7a971d66b15c36da7ae01be3606858e29c2cb7391e836903e7114ae7d8", "ja": "『みんなのご当地！』っていう番組を覚えてるか？\n前に一回、ゲスト出演させてもらった……。", "zh": "你还记得《大家的当地特色！》这个节目吗？\n之前有一次，让你去当过嘉宾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "a5b39d170762ddebe2721d0dece1c4dc26febbdd7f9d71e38e73ca2e2e5d97fe", "ja": "もちろん覚えてるヨ！　ご当地の紹介をしながら、\n美味しいものを食べたりする、バラエティ番組だよネ？", "zh": "当然记得呀！那是边介绍各地特色，边品尝美食的综艺节目，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "da44edb81127d088099963855ee3389c693afeda0d24961761d973e3c07efc97", "ja": "前に出た時、す～っごく楽しかったもん♪", "zh": "上次参加的时候，真的特别开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9bcef86c8ced02e6f81ab0dfaa99d20a54ac6dfbefde885b0d857cb8f510f7c9", "ja": "その番組からオファーが来てて。もうすぐ番組改変で、\n紹介内容が日本から世界に広がるらしいんだけど……。", "zh": "那个节目发来邀约了。听说节目马上要改版，介绍的内容也会从日本扩展到全世界……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1009_p", "source_sha256": "325a0bedde160b6fbc07ab03d8c2cc71c9518c7a2344c471d749eca32c1757d3", "ja": "月間ゲストとして4回出演して、\n評判が良ければ、次のレギュラーにという話だ。", "zh": "作为月度嘉宾出演4次，\n如果口碑不错，就有可能成为下一个常驻嘉宾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "162cd503e1d085d4871c0e1c3d91af5fa9ba30f13032af0a0394fbddf3697715", "ja": "えっ……レギュラー！？　それってすごいコトだよネ？\n{$P$}！", "zh": "诶……成为固定嘉宾！？那不是很厉害吗？{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b33dfe2cc0fc1ddf8e6a63b2a662f13cd7e6887b899604d898f23b73a5ccb727", "ja": "もちろん。ただ、ちょっと気になる事があって。\nそれで、エレナの意向を確かめたかったんだけど。", "zh": "当然了。不过，有件事稍微有点让我在意。\n所以才想确认一下艾莲娜的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fb9a1c9f9681e02074f8d7d749f2e1e581c6af451b3c51e8e1ea342a1c2f5e9e", "ja": "エレナの前にレギュラーだった人は、アイドルじゃなく\n外国人……つまり、『外国にルーツがある』枠なんだ。", "zh": "在艾莲娜之前担任常规成员的人，不是偶像，而是外国人……也就是说，属于“有外国血统”的类别。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "05e0eff0b90f6bcc8e45b01e9553a00e82bf1a7d492bf29d028a864687af179d", "ja": "？　えっと……ワタシはブラジルと日本のダブルで、\n日本で暮らしてるほうが長いんだけど……いいのかナ？", "zh": "？呃……我是巴西和日本的混血，在日本生活的时间更长……这样也可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "adee66c05e24a4e8f010f3b230e68da5e2bb7b878bb6218fc81933a5ce96557a", "ja": "見た目が、外国人っぽいからってコト？", "zh": "是因为长相看起来像外国人的缘故？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0f1293d9c9621e77796040c78728ad7cc13aaa82824241fdf213b3a3fdd4de13", "ja": "もちろん、それについても説明した。\nだから、そういう事だと思う。", "zh": "当然，关于这点我也解释过了。\n所以，我想应该就是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1016_p", "source_sha256": "328db74f28b684bc39bc41a21125b67c9b07f8c0bd5ce46b628e3c5e514fc4e4", "ja": "エレナはブラジルで生まれて、お父さんが日本人だ。\n国籍は、どちらにもあるんだったな。", "zh": "艾蕾娜出生在巴西，父亲是日本人。\n国籍也是两边都有，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "6790f7b9b4cdfa5c5bab897b802b3edcc3146df1d503a9d7195fc9059bc1ad12", "ja": "そうだヨー。", "zh": "没错哦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a3c17ff5321c78faf2b0d13560f7d1552aefeaa6e048f7191e331e00a4dbc1e3", "ja": "外国にルーツがある人にとって、自分の国籍というのは\nとても重要で、センシティブな問題だと思う。", "zh": "对有着外国背景的人来说，自己的国籍应该\n是一个非常重要且敏感的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2e3f7f809f711a9634c9c2c53f1fdf6b21bd6d084ded2876d1960787f6a32f61", "ja": "だから仕事とはいえ、『外国人枠』に入ってしまって\nいいのか、確認したいと思ったんだ。", "zh": "所以，虽说这是工作，但我还是想确认一下，自己被归入“外国人名额”真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d06005a607f2dcc3d1282dfce8eab275d9dd03d08f5bf6c0e47284724122e162", "ja": "どうする。今回は断ろうか？", "zh": "怎么办？这次要不就拒绝吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "3db5e525547fbcd2d99f81255f54c2c72b79125045a42b0a068f41e9ed3398d9", "ja": "……ううん、いいヨ！　だってワタシが\n日本とブラジルの間にいるのは、本当のことだしネ。", "zh": "……不，不用了！因为我确实正处在日本和巴西之间嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "36efed3172eb53d9b4509446f32cad7652614d861b338843252890e9de5917d8", "ja": "全国放送の番組だし、チャンスには違いないんでしょ？\nなら、ワタシを覚えてもらえばいいだけだもん！", "zh": "毕竟是全国播出的节目，肯定是个机会吧？  \n那就只要让大家记住我就行了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "b89d1d61760cea8c1b9c75e66e870a6913a3cede92af9990101d485123afe239", "ja": "島原エレナは、外国人じゃなくてアイドルだって、\n全国のみんなに知ってもらうヨ～！", "zh": "岛原艾琳娜才不是外国人，而是偶像——\n我要让全国的大家都知道哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1025_p", "source_sha256": "328d91196887ca7340287a53489119f9d2e6a219d8a32e1a91ed30fae486b97a", "ja": "わかった。エレナがそう言ってくれるなら、\n全力でサポートする。頑張ろうな！", "zh": "我知道了。既然艾莲娜都这么说了，\n我一定会全力支持你的。一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "8935363d85722bceb35a66c663f45227607d2b75ebeda9d689c74a9623bf83e6", "ja": "うん！　ありがと、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1027_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1028_003mik", "source_sha256": "3e31aa681c5d262c90172403c00b25b8efd4e2ffa45828da5dfb30c8ab5f4f2a", "ja": "あ、{$P$}とエレナだ。\nもう来てたんだね。", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}和艾蕾娜。\n你们已经到了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1029_p", "source_sha256": "5fd8feb3a3153a425c816d98dd882bfc2efded4174895957a92ab4cc0ebc4c0f", "ja": "おはよう、美希。みんなも一緒か。", "zh": "早上好，美希。大家也一起来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "e08bf37f72ea17cc32c347165f3edf26bc78b3eac4d655dd54d9140721e0fedf", "ja": "おはようございます……。\nう～……。", "zh": "早上好……。\n唔～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "75d0ce772cb466a2d6800f79aaf3aac420d6e889329bbe1f533e5c283b0beebe", "ja": "？　タマキ、どうかしたノ？　元気がないネ。", "zh": "？环，怎么了？看起来没什么精神呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1032_052kao", "source_sha256": "3993e615ddb7bf855b87d596a4ebefd86377a31747d2e5fc52f23874ce0c141b", "ja": "エレナちゃん……それがね……。", "zh": "艾莲娜……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "5ac247da562eb5d2c104d5d846a1563f4ee62318a91efc7e1542bfad8d215cee", "ja": "えれな……。あのね、\nきのうから、こぶんがいないんだぞ……。", "zh": "艾琳娜……是这样的，\n从昨天开始，小弟就不见了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1034_040tam", "source_sha256": "319a2ad12797b0574b607c28041bad98077750126390498f1f3aa0bce17691eb", "ja": "たまき、ずっとさがしてるんだけど\n見つからなくて……どこに行っちゃったのかな……。", "zh": "环，一直在找，可是怎么都找不到……到底跑到哪里去了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1035_019min", "source_sha256": "e2f2eeeb280fc925e897775456954780c26e604c7dde1d1b9bd76dca451378f9", "ja": "私たちも、今朝いっしょに探してみたんですけど。\nこぶんちゃん、全然見つからなくて……。", "zh": "我们今早也一起找过了。\n小子分，完全找不到……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1036_003mik", "source_sha256": "8f08ffa9f33c4a60f03923184f204f0e9a979e1bee502daffce20144eac4c20b", "ja": "{$P$}、ずっと劇場にいたんでしょ？\nどこかで見かけなかった？", "zh": "{$P$}，你一直待在剧场里吧？\n有没有在哪儿见到过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1037_p", "source_sha256": "0bc029acd229c2b83197bebdc2fd47dbdcd011100a82272a093fb935a2abb48b", "ja": "いや、見てないな……。", "zh": "没有，没看到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1038_018ele", "source_sha256": "50517a792c5cef049388f1055f4d6e6932d4b3b1d6455bd376fa584dec6c3bca", "ja": "そっか……心配だネ。それじゃ、\nミーティングが終わったら、一緒に探そっか？", "zh": "这样啊……真让人担心呢。那我们开完会议后，一起去找找吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1039_p", "source_sha256": "68b3c978a72d25316f42b84930c0d459b72a16b891d4ec7c6a10267d8a3d4f73", "ja": "そうだな、俺も一緒に探そう。\n青羽さんにも、こぶんを見かけてないか聞いてみるよ。", "zh": "对啊，我也一起找吧。也去问问青羽小姐有没有见过小伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1040_019min", "source_sha256": "aab2023cda48810021c0fb55a87d9297698b5e245cb12ce7c4ac6e1ff27fb1cf", "ja": "大勢で探せば、こぶんちゃん、きっと見つかるよ。", "zh": "大家一起找的话，小弟一定能找到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1041_040tam", "source_sha256": "ee0388db6a508520af2c14afc8b6175bae3dabfdd33e4ee33772c07cf508061f", "ja": "うん。みんな、ありがと……。", "zh": "嗯。谢谢大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1042_052kao", "source_sha256": "cc3cf0aff4494d13121eb0caccfc0a0e5e12abc8e7c05fcdec235ffd591de53d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます。\nミーティングしちゃいましょうか。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你。\n我们这就开始开会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1043_p", "source_sha256": "ac69da36937d2529fd54b0db5e4e26c61efbc5b742b2a6645e2ec4ead1f59392", "ja": "そうですね！\nそれじゃ、次の定期公演についてだけど……。", "zh": "是啊！\n那么，关于下次的定期公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1044_null", "source_sha256": "cb30d7e0ad2edacfa35f3e46b67d8caac11a8ea8d134511ffa5dbaa157a33a66", "ja": "ミーティング終了後、帰宅中……", "zh": "会议结束后，正在回家途中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1045_018ele", "source_sha256": "61be6c8bb36a390f107b35bc5e17cf4537e3a6c32327fb403244d4995af4a876", "ja": "コブン、見つかってよかったヨ～。\nタマキと、仲良しだもんネ。", "zh": "小弟，能找到你真是太好了哟～。\n毕竟你和环关系很好嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1046_018ele", "source_sha256": "186176a29bc8286e93ce06c7783aa24ce0d480e91516d500ffdf350646f126da", "ja": "仲良し、か……。", "zh": "要好啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1048_018ele", "source_sha256": "8fad71857e7bdbfd97fccb99e7520f8e1fc2478d3d9c3a0d1c917fcfe9db47d7", "ja": "もう。またケンカしてる……。", "zh": "真是的。又在吵架了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1049_018ele", "source_sha256": "e1c8531f8ade46bf188adb9b82bba62926ba98175717c3dd3cd29549c82416f2", "ja": "ただいま～。……ママン、ジョアンも。\n大きな声でケンカしてるから、外まで聞こえてるよ？", "zh": "我回来啦～……妈妈，还有乔安也是。\n你们吵架的声音太大了，在外面都听见了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1050_elenahaha", "source_sha256": "e4cf4e76bbd69afba87fe37e947ca09ea1011b61fa4a0184061a5b6c02355097", "ja": "おかえりなさい、エレナ！　だって、ジョアンが\nちっとも手伝ってくれないんだも～ん！", "zh": "欢迎回来，艾莲娜！因为乔安一点忙都不肯帮我嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1051_joan", "source_sha256": "2d2c629235c7542c0a60b5e73f2a1d9d17a333c0399b1313a3d65204849b911f", "ja": "料理の味見しろ、なんて言うからだろ！\nオレはいま、勉強中で忙しいんだってば！", "zh": "还不是因为你说让我尝料理的味道！\n我说了我现在正在学习，很忙的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1052_joan", "source_sha256": "2c0780c2f171077b2acab7b520ceb954cc38920f57602e4941935e1cae4eb3f5", "ja": "お母さんこそ、忘れてない？\nオレが受験生だって事！", "zh": "反倒是妈妈，你忘了吗？  \n我可是要参加升学考试的考生啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1053_elenahaha", "source_sha256": "39503f7e91f4cb3c85feeff63fb32d63bfc6bb7794d29bb2ebfc9d63adf9dee5", "ja": "そんなに心配しなくても、ダイジョーブだヨ～。\nジョアン、すっごく頭いいし♪", "zh": "不用那么担心，没问题的哟～。\n乔安可聪明了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1054_joan", "source_sha256": "c29c3d3b01c7558d190dbec9f329d7897b404e49c8161ac1f1f8d26886500989", "ja": "またそうやって、すぐ簡単に言う……！\n人の気も知らないで！", "zh": "又这样，张口就来……！\n根本不懂人家的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1055_joan", "source_sha256": "083c53b4770d085f06a1834e4042300ee3fa83ca48b5d41d702e08e891b7de28", "ja": "お母さんは外国人だから……\nどうせ、オレの気持ちがわからないんだよ！", "zh": "妈妈是外国人，所以……\n反正她不会明白我的感受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1056_elenahaha", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1057_se", "source_sha256": "b7d769a933cc8cb3d4f3dc26614c33cd76e85fd1cebd43fb943338373783a379", "ja": "ガチャガチャ、バタン！", "zh": "嘎啦嘎啦，砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1058_018ele", "source_sha256": "764805d39120f4d293fbc190447f9d7a5d10ab185db18a1dfbf87f81e36f6613", "ja": "ジョアン、待って！\n……ママン、ワタシちょっと行ってくる！", "zh": "乔安，等一下！\n……妈妈，我先去一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1059_elenahaha", "source_sha256": "b90d419ec1b880c145948c6b4de548d8bc486891bb0794d1e19e7b944abb7d63", "ja": "あっ……エレナ！", "zh": "啊……艾琳娜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_128_1060_se", "source_sha256": "3acc3d8d20a36f0a3257a2150ed2ff29259cbfec1d7baf7c3ef5ae9411f0f515", "ja": "バタバタバタ……", "zh": "噔噔噔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
